{"id": "0x012E", "plain_text": "012e", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x012F", "plain_text": "Watch out, [PLAYER]!\nElectricity is running through\nthis green slimy thing!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0130", "plain_text": "0130", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0131", "plain_text": "Watch out [PLAYER]!\nElectricity is running through\nthis red slimy thing!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0132", "plain_text": "Watch out [PLAYER]!\nElectricity is running through\nthis blue slimy thing!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0133", "plain_text": "This switch...\nIt doesn't look like you can press\nit down with your weight alone,\n[PLAYER]...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "NAME", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0134", "plain_text": "0134", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0135", "plain_text": "0135", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0136", "plain_text": "0136", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0137", "plain_text": "The red slimy thing is gone! \nThat must be because you cut the\nred tail! Will that work with \nthe other ones too?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0138", "plain_text": "0138", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0139", "plain_text": "There's a switch beyond this \nwall!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013A", "plain_text": "It looks like there is something\nup there on top of the platform!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013B", "plain_text": "013b", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013C", "plain_text": "013c", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013D", "plain_text": "WHAAAT!?\n--- PAGE ---\nLook at all those flags!\nCan you figure out which ones are\nreal?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013E", "plain_text": "013e", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x013F", "plain_text": "013f", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0140", "plain_text": "The Great Deku Tree has \nsummoned you!\nPlease come with me!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0141", "plain_text": "C'mon! Be brave!\nLet's go into the \nGreat Deku Tree!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0142", "plain_text": "The Great Deku Tree wanted us\nto go to visit the princess at\nHyrule Castle.... Shouldn't we\nget going?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0143", "plain_text": "The girl from the ranch asked us\nto find her father...I wonder where\nhe is?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0144", "plain_text": "I wonder where we'll find the \nprincess in this big old castle?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0145", "plain_text": "What would Saria say if we told\nher we're going to save Hyrule?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0146", "plain_text": "Impa said that the Spiritual Stone\nof Fire is somewhere on Death\nMountain.", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0147", "plain_text": "Let's go inside the Dodongo's\nCavern using a Bomb Flower!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0148", "plain_text": "Darunia said that a fairy\nlives on top of Death Mountain,\ndidn't he?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0149", "plain_text": "I wonder if Saria knows anything\nabout the other Spiritual Stone?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014A", "plain_text": "It seems Princess Ruto somehow \ngot inside Jabu-Jabu's belly...", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014B", "plain_text": "You collected three Spiritual\nStones! Let's go back to Hyrule\nCastle!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014C", "plain_text": "Those people on the white horse...\nthey were Zelda and Impa, weren't\nthey? It looked like they threw \nsomething into the moat!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014D", "plain_text": "Let's go check inside the \nTemple of Time.", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014E", "plain_text": "Should we believe what Sheik said \nand go to Kakariko Village?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x014F", "plain_text": "014f", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0150", "plain_text": "I wonder what's going on in the\nforest right now... I'm worried\nabout Saria, too!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0151", "plain_text": "That cloud over Death Mountain...\nthere is something strange about \nit...", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0152", "plain_text": "An arctic wind is blowing from\nZora's River...do you feel it?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0153", "plain_text": "Those Iron Boots look like\nthey weigh a ton! If you wear\nthose boots, you may be able to\nwalk at the bottom of a lake.", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0154", "plain_text": "Let's look for someone who might\nknow something about the other\nSages!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0155", "plain_text": "That monster! It came out of the \nwell in the village! Let's go \ncheck out the well!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0156", "plain_text": "I wonder who built the Spirit\nTemple, and for what purpose?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0157", "plain_text": "Have you ever played the \nNocturne of Shadow that Sheik\ntaught you?", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_69)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0158", "plain_text": "The desert...that is where\nGanondorf the Evil King was born.\nIf we go there, we might find\nsomething...", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0159", "plain_text": "0159", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015A", "plain_text": "Equip the Silver Gauntlets \nand try to move things you \ncouldn't budge before!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015B", "plain_text": "The one who is waiting for us at\nthe Temple of Time...it could be...", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015C", "plain_text": "We have to save Princess Zelda\nfrom her imprisonment in Ganon's\nCastle!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015D", "plain_text": "015D", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015E", "plain_text": "015E", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x015F", "plain_text": "[PLAYER]...\nTry to keep moving!!", "category": "NAVI", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0160", "plain_text": "I don't mind talking to you \nusing the Ocarina's magic, but\nI'd really like to talk to you\nface-to-face!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0161", "plain_text": "The forest is connected to many \nplaces! If you can hear my song,\nyou must be somewhere that is\nconnected to the forest!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0162", "plain_text": "I was so happy to hear that\nMr. Darunia loved my song so\nmuch!\n--- PAGE ---\nI was even happier to find out\nthat it helped you on your quest,\n[PLAYER]!\nTee hee hee!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "NAME", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0163", "plain_text": "Are you collecting Spiritual\nStones? You have one more to\nfind? You mean the Spiritual \nStone of Water, don't you?\n--- PAGE ---\nThe Great Deku Tree once told me\nthat King Zora, ruler of Zora's \nDomain, has it...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0164", "plain_text": "Are you collecting Spiritual\nStones? You have one more to\nfind? You mean the Spiritual \nStone of Fire, don't you?\n--- PAGE ---\nThe Great Deku Tree once told me\nthat Mr. Darunia of the Gorons\nhas it...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0165", "plain_text": "[PLAYER]...\nI don't know what it is...\nI have this feeling of dread...\n--- PAGE ---\nThe Castle...\nYes, something bad is happening\nat the Castle!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NAME", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0166", "plain_text": "What? Your ocarina sounds...\ndifferent somehow... \nHave you been practicing a lot,\n[PLAYER]?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "NAME", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0167", "plain_text": "Are you looking for a temple?\nA mysterious bird once told me...\n--- PAGE ---\n\"Eyes that can see through \ndarkness will open in a storm.\"\nDo you have any idea what he \nmeant by this?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0168", "plain_text": "Where are you, [PLAYER]?\nAre you looking for a temple?\nI once heard a mysterious bird \nsay...\n--- PAGE ---\n\"Go, young man. Go to the\nDesert Goddess with an ocarina.\"\nDo you have any idea what he\nmay have meant by this?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NAME", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0169", "plain_text": "Did you find all the temples yet?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016A", "plain_text": "Great! You're safe!\nI knew I would hear from\nyou again!\n--- PAGE ---\nI'm in the Forest Temple!\nThe forest spirits were calling\nfor help, so I went to check it\nout...\n--- PAGE ---\nBut it's full of evil monsters!\nHelp me, [PLAYER]!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NAME", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016B", "plain_text": "[PLAYER]...\nAt first, I didn't want to become \nthe Sage of the Forest....\n--- PAGE ---\nBut I'm glad now.\n--- PAGE ---\nBecause I am helping you to save\nHyrule, [PLAYER]!\nYes, I am!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016C", "plain_text": "If all six Sages come together, \nwe can imprison Ganondorf, the \nKing of Evil, in the Sacred Realm.\n--- PAGE ---\nBut, in order to make a perfect\nseal, we need the seventh \nSage.\n--- PAGE ---\nSomeone you know must be that\nSage, [PLAYER]...\n--- PAGE ---\nFrom now on, you must travel \nbetween past and future to\nawaken the remaining Sages!\n--- PAGE ---\nKeep up the good work,\n[PLAYER]!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "NAME", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016D", "plain_text": "We, the Six Sages, are channeling\nour power to you!\n--- PAGE ---\nThe destiny of Hyrule depends \nupon you!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016E", "plain_text": "016e", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x016F", "plain_text": "016f", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0180", "plain_text": "I can hear a voice from\nsomewhere...\n--- PAGE ---\nIt's saying:\n\"Collect five silver Rupees...\"", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "SHIFT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0181", "plain_text": "This wall...it's saying something!\n--- PAGE ---\nIt says:\nIf you want to see a ferry to the\nother world, come here...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "NEWLINE", "SHIFT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0182", "plain_text": "0182", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0183", "plain_text": "If you want to ride that boat, be \ncareful! It looks very old... Who\nknows when it might sink?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0184", "plain_text": "There is a door over here... Is \nthere any way to get across?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0185", "plain_text": "0185", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0186", "plain_text": "That red ice...it's so weird!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0187", "plain_text": "0187", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0188", "plain_text": "0188", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0189", "plain_text": "This blue fire...it doesn't seem\nnatural. Maybe you can use it for\nsomething?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018A", "plain_text": "018a", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018B", "plain_text": "018b", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018C", "plain_text": "The fires on the torches are gone.\nSeems like the ghosts took them \naway!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018D", "plain_text": "Look, [PLAYER]! A torch\nis lit! That's because\nyou beat a ghost, isn't it?!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018E", "plain_text": "018e", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x018F", "plain_text": "There are arrows painted on the \nfloor!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0190", "plain_text": "This corridor is all twisted!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0191", "plain_text": "Watch for the shadows of\nmonsters that hang from the\nceiling.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0192", "plain_text": "There's a treasure chest here.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
